ther and how consent was obtained from people whose data you’re 397 using/curating? [Yes] See Section § 4 398 (e) Did you discuss whether the data you are using/curating contains personally identiﬁable 399 information or offensive content? [Yes] As the dataset used in this work is originally 400 created for general purpose QA and we believe that those datasets contain few examples 401 that risk our participants. We will describe that in details in Appendix. 402 5. If you used crowdsourcing or conducted research with human subjects... 403 (a) Did you include the full text of instructions given to participants and screenshots, if 404 applicable? [Yes] We will include the instructions in Appendix. 405 (b) Did you describe any potential participant risks, with links to Institutional Review 406 Board (IRB) approvals, if applicable? [Yes] As the dataset used in this work is originally 407 created for general purpose QA and we believe that those datasets contain few examples 408 that risk our participants. We will describe that in details in Appendix. 409 (c) Did you include the estimated hourly wage paid to participants and the total amount 410 spent on participant compensation? [N/A] 411 12
